    "q-81600": {
      "dom_id": "step-q81600",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $¬A∧(C∨B)?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the conjunction over the disjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n¬A∧(C∨B)≡(¬A∧C)∨(¬A∧B)\n$$\n\nNow, since $¬A∧C≡C∧¬A,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(¬A∧C)∨(¬A∧B)≡(C∧¬A)∨(¬A∧B).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
