    "q-128637": {
      "dom_id": "step-q128637",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $A∧(¬Y∨C)?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the conjunction over the disjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\nA∧(¬Y∨C)≡(A∧¬Y)∨(A∧C)\n$$\n\nNow, since $A∧¬Y≡¬Y∧A$ and $A∧C≡C∧A,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(A∧¬Y)∨(A∧C)≡(¬Y∧A)∨(C∧A).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
