    "q-81608": {
      "dom_id": "step-q81608",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(A∧C)∨B?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(A∧C)∨B≡(A∨B)∧(C∨B)\n$$\n\nNow, since $C∨B≡B∨C,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(A∨B)∧(C∨B)≡(A∨B)∧(B∨C).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
