    "q-128640": {
      "dom_id": "step-q128640",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(R∧P)∨¬Q?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(R∧P)∨¬Q≡(R∨¬Q)∧(P∨¬Q)\n$$\n\nNow, since $R∨¬Q≡¬Q∨R,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(R∨¬Q)∧(P∨¬Q)≡(¬Q∨R)∧(P∨¬Q).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
