      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $H∨(¬M∧N)?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the disjunction over the conjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\nH∨(¬M∧N)≡(H∨¬M)∧(H∨N)\n$$\n\nNow, since $H∨¬M≡¬M∨H$ and $H∨N≡N∨H$ we can write\n\n$$\n(H∨¬M)∧(H∨N)≡(¬M∨H)∧(N∨H).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
