    "q-128647": {
      "dom_id": "step-q128647",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(¬R∧Q)∨(P∧¬R)?$",
      "worked_solution": "First,  since $¬R∧Q≡Q∧¬R,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(¬R∧Q)∨(P∧¬R)≡(Q∧¬R)∨(P∧¬R).\n$$\n\nThen,  we can factor out the conjunction with $¬R,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(Q∧¬R)∨(P∧¬R)≡(Q∨P)∧¬R\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
