    "q-128652": {
      "dom_id": "step-q128652",
      "name": "Question 19",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(C∨¬B)∧(C∨A)?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we can factor out the disjunction with $C,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(C∨¬B)∧(C∨A)≡C∨(¬B∧A)\n$$\n\nNow, since $¬B∧A≡A∧¬B,$ we can write\n\n$$\nC∨(¬B∧A)≡C∨(A∧¬B).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-128652-a",
